          "locator": "Limiting values",
          "normalized_extract": "VCEO/VCBO -40 V, VEBO -6 V; IC -200 mA."
        },
        {
          "physical_pdf_page_index": 2,
          "printed_page_label": "3",
          "locator": "Static and switching characteristics",
          "normalized_extract": "At 25 C: ICBO<=50 nA at VCB=-30 V,IE=0; VCEsat<=250 mV,VBEsat<=850 mV at IC=-10mA,IB=-1mA. Storage<=225 ns and fall<=75 ns need IBon=-1 mA,IBoff=+1 mA,ICon=-10 mA. No hot or passive-base-release guarantee inferred."
        }
      ],
